Modifications include: renaming to arlclue; interview prep documents
(resume, job description, notes) injected into prompts; automatic
English/French/Arabic language detection and answer-language control;
system-audio (loopback/monitor) capture with question detection; and a
fix so the non-streaming Gemini path sends the system instruction.
